ct prices on this website final?<i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="faq-answer" id="faq17671" hidden><p>Products and PKR prices are published by the Pound Store team. Availability and prices can vary by branch, so please confirm with your nearest store before visiting.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq22622">Can I order online or check out?<i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="faq-answer" id="faq22622" hidden><p>Not at the moment. The website is catalogue-first and has no cart, checkout or payment. Use the store directory to find your nearest branch and confirm availability.</p></div></div><div class="faq-group-title"><h3>Store locations</h3></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq27830">How can I find a store?<i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="faq-answer" id="faq27830" hidden><p>Use the Find a Store page to browse currently active branch records by city and area. Select a city to see individual branch pins when coordinates are available; use a branch card to open directions.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq32601">How many branches are listed?<i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="faq-answer" id="faq32601" hidden><p>The directory shows the active branches and cities currently published by the admin team. Counts change when branches or cities are added, updated or made inactive.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq36972">Why should I call before travelling to the warehouse?<i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="faq-answer" id="faq36972" hidden><p>Check the branch card for the saved address, contact number and directions link. If branch-specific details are incomplete, confirm the location with the team before travelling.</p></div></div><div class="faq-group-title"><h3>Franchise and sourcing</h3></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq42650">How can I ask about a franchise?<i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="faq-answer" id="faq42650" hidden><p>Visit the Franchise page to review the published support areas and use the contact details to speak with the team. Submit the enquiry form and the team can review your request.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq47191">What investment is required?<i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="faq-answer" id="faq47191" hidden><p>The public website says figures depend on city, shop size and opening inventory. Ask Pound Store for current approved figures; investment and terms should always be confirmed directly with the company.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq51762">What support does the company describe?<i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="faq-answer" id="faq51762" hidden><p>Its public franchise information lists direct import pricing, central warehouse supply, setup and training, marketing/branding and territory arrangements.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq56203">How does sourcing work?<i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="faq-answer" id="faq56203" hidden><p>The company describes four stages: direct import, quality control, warehousing and distribution.</p></div></div><div class="faq-group-title"><h3>Contact and enquiries</h3></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq60600">How can I contact Pound Store?<i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="faq-answer" id="faq60600" hidden><p>The public website lists 0347 0006050 and poundstorewarehouse@gmail.com, with a written contact/warehouse address of Alipur Chowk, Gujranwala.</p></div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" data-faq-question aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq64831">How do I send an enquiry?<i class="bi bi-plus-lg" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="faq-answer" id="faq64831" hidden><p>Complete the contact or franchise enquiry form on the relevant page. You will see a confirmation after the submission is processed.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
